{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Just going back to that picnic, and thinking about what went wrong. What could be done better next time. Out in the wild there'll surely be beasts to face, and letting one get away and endanger people is enough.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:02:50.870000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879712359919271936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Well. Might be an unpopular opinion, but don't start turning people away if they ask for a piece out of your picnic. Sure, one of them turned out to be a horrible murderer wolf, but that's just one-- I'm not helping, am I?`","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:04:29.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879712773536354305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Not an unpopular opinion. We can't just help no one because what, one person out of how many? turned out to be a murderer.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:05:12.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879712953790791740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Oh, I don't intend to. I mean after it already happened. It was me, Fuddles, and Kukudh right there when the beast changed shape, so I was a first respondent.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:05:46.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879713096971739147","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`You're good kids.` Orphy nods.","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:06:35.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879713304061313135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she shrugs. 'We're doing what we can for the world. Help the swarm, the swarm helps you.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:07:48.448000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879713608051879967","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I'd rather help a thousand people and one of them turn out to be a murderer, than not help those people and 999 of them then have trouble.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:08:13.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879713712984952873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`The math checks out. 100% of strangers you've invited to your picnic turned out to be murderers. So just keep inviting people to your picnic. Then it's going to be 50%, then 25%, and it'll just keep going down.`","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:09:03.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879713923874574357","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Unless you count weddings as sort of big fancy picnics. In that case, our statistics are already much better.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:09:38.242000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879714068561297458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`If the wedding is outdoors, then it's a picnic.`","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:09:54.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879714134772572170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'So, yes, then.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:10:49.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879714367371870249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'The point still stands, though. While yes, inviting the wolf to join the picnic caused this, if we hadn't, then they'd still be on the loose attacking other people without us having any idea.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T13:12:10.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879714707433484338","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
