{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Wolf normally, shapeshifts to some degree.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:45:41.847000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879828839839178782","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"a couple weeks ago, it was a family of wolves... had a little child with them... probably not the same ones. I've been afraid they'd be back\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:46:19.246000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-24T20:46:49.721000Z","id":"879828996701974588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...this definitely wasn't a child...'","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:46:48.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879829117887987762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't think it was a werewolf. Werewolves try to bite and turn you, attack in a frenzy. That one was a hunter, just interested in clawing us to make us bleed. And meat.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:47:53.704000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879829392887513159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Demetrius is searching for its lair, while Gaillardia is preparing her thing. And we have several people very angry at that creature. It's just a matter of time.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:50:41.510000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879830096716894238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine nods. '...myself included. It can't be allowed to live. I take no pleasure in its death, but... Eloise tried to help it, as best as possible, and got betrayed. How many other disappearances are related to this beast?'","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:53:19.818000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879830760708800562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Should I go offer to help with the list of things?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:53:32.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879830814886592584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'll see what else I can find out about this while you guys rest... there might be a way for mercy\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:53:53.152000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879830900521725962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(mercy killing perhaps)","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:54:07.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879830961683050527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Eloise already tried mercy...'","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:54:44.630000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879831116436107324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If you won't be busy with other things, any help will be welcome. For now it was just us two, Irynx, and Bo aware of this. And familiars, of course. The more ground we cover, the quicker Eloise can be brought back.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:55:22.117000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879831273667969054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'll help as much as I can... thanks for telling me about it\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:55:56.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879831418774097920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she wanders over to the pond, and looks into it. 'Gil, I hope this is alright. But I feel like it needs to be done... to save the lives of many others... so please grant me the strength to face my fears.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:56:04.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879831451586154527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"And yeah, there was an attempt at mercy and avoiding violence. We might be past that point. Regardless of the outcome, the situation would have to become such that we'd be the ones in control of it and putting down conditions.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T20:57:02.376000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-24T20:57:22.825000Z","id":"879831694184677376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
